
                ASTM A36 Steel Specification

                Chemical Composition:
                - Carbon: 0.25-0.29%
                - Manganese: 0.80-1.20%
                - Phosphorus: ≤0.040%
                - Sulfur: ≤0.050%

                Mechanical Properties:
                - Yield Strength: 250 MPa (36 ksi) minimum
                - Tensile Strength: 400-550 MPa (58-80 ksi)
                - Elongation: 20% minimum in 2 inches

                Applications:
                - General structural steel
                - Building frames
                - Bridges
                - General fabrication
                